{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233700","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233700","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1423370001:1":{"text":"せんせー、もう授業の時間だろ？まだ始めないの？","source_cn":"老师，是不是到上课的时间了，怎么还不开始上课呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E9586C5EFB17E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423370002:1":{"text":"ジュール、ヒナがいないみたいだけど、どこに行ったか知ってる？あの子抜きで授業はできないわ。","source_cn":"朱尔，你知道希娜去哪了吗？她没有来上课……我们不能丢下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA69083CB0BB76AEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423370003:1":{"text":"でも、ヒナは来ないって言ってたよ。それでも待たなきゃだめ？","source_cn":"老师，希娜跟我说过……她不会来了。我们真的要等她吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE1F4DB020D7C96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423370004:1":{"text":"ヒナは他に何か言ってた？","source_cn":"可以跟老师讲讲，她还跟你说了些什么吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A7C1F7F04E68164","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423370005:1":{"text":"えっと、「どうせオーロナはすぐ王都に戻る」とか「今は物珍しいだけ。飽きたらすぐ見捨てられる」とか……僕たちが違うって言ったら、そのまま走ってどっか行っちゃったんだ。","source_cn":"她一直跟我们说“欧罗娜很快就会回王城的”“她只是一时兴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2674F984612A71","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423370006:1":{"text":"あいつ、僕たちが見捨てたって思ったのかな……でも、授業には行きたくないって言うから……","source_cn":"希娜会不会觉得我们抛弃了她……可是，她又不愿意来上课……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B89ABEBCBBC38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1423370006":{"text":"あいつ、僕たちが見捨てたって思ったのかな……でも、授業には行きたくないって言うから……","source_cn":"希娜会不会觉得我们抛弃了她……可是，她又不愿意来上课……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B89ABEBCBBC38D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1423370007:1":{"text":"南だよ。多分、狩りじゃないかな。機嫌が悪くなると、狩りに行くから。","source_cn":"她往南边去了，我猜应该是去打猎了吧。她一不开心，就会去打猎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EF62DDB1070BCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1423370008:1":{"text":"ありがとう、ジュール。あなたはここで待ってて、先生がヒナを連れ戻してくるから！","source_cn":"谢谢你，朱尔，你先在这里等着，老师会把希娜找到带回来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8334DAC2410EFF06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"ヒナはどっちへ行ったか覚えてるか？","source_cn":"你还记得希娜离开的方向吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC8F2621DB9F8AE41","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"ヒナはどっちへ行ったか覚えてるか？","female":"ヒナはどっちへ行ったか覚えてる？","variant_male_record_index":"73946","variant_fe